{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, fully responsive Shopify Liquid section for Kiss & Kry titled "Giving Back – Outgrown, Not Outworn."
    
    IMPORTANT: Use the uploaded reference image as the exact visual design reference. Reproduce the layout, proportions, spacing, typography, colours, card styles, image placements and overall composition as closely as possible.
    
    Do not redesign, simplify or reinterpret the layout.
    
    The section should communicate Kiss & Kry's sustainable babywear return and redistribution initiative.
    
    1. OVERALL DESIGN & COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Create a full-width premium editorial-style section.
    
    Main background:
    
    Deep muted olive green: #5E6848 (approximate).
    
    Primary text: Warm ivory #F6F2E5.
    
    Secondary text: Muted sage-beige #C7C7AD.
    
    Accent colour: Warm mustard gold #E9AC29.
    
    Light card background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Dark olive card: #495239.
    
    Borders: Subtle translucent sage/olive.
    
    Design characteristics:
    
    Luxury editorial aesthetic.
    
    Premium babywear branding.
    
    Minimal, sophisticated and spacious.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle background decorative circular outlines.
    
    No unnecessary gradients.
    
    No excessive shadows.
    
    Avoid generic ecommerce layouts.
    
    Use Montserrat for all typography.
    
    2. SECTION ONE – HERO / GIVING BACK INTRODUCTION
    
    Create a two-column desktop layout.
    
    LEFT COLUMN – 48% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "GIVING BACK"
    
    Add a short horizontal mustard-gold line before the label.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Outgrown,
    Not Outworn."
    
    Typography:
    
    Large, bold Montserrat.
    
    Approximately 40–44px desktop.
    
    Warm ivory colour.
    
    Tight line height.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Description:
    
    "At Kiss & Kry, we believe true luxury goes beyond premium fabrics and adorable designs. It's compassion, community and sustainability — and it sits at the heart of our 'Giving Back' initiative."
    
    Use 14px text with comfortable line spacing.
    
    Below the description, create an editorial image composition:
    
    Large vertical image on the left showing a premium cardboard return box with Kiss & Kry branding.
    
    Smaller rectangular image on the right showing a baby garment being held or folded.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle overlapping composition.
    
    Add small ivory pill labels:
    "Step 01 · Return"
    "Step 02 · Redistribute"
    
    Add a circular olive-and-gold seal overlapping the images, featuring a return/recycle arrow and small curved text:
    "RETURN • REWARD • REDISTRIBUTE"
    
    RIGHT COLUMN – 52% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE"
    
    Add a thin horizontal line extending towards the right.
    
    Create two vertically stacked process cards.
    
    STEP 01 – RETURN & REWARD
    
    Card styling:
    
    Background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Rounded corners: 22px.
    
    Generous internal padding.
    
    Light, premium appearance.
    
    Top section:
    
    Circular olive icon background.
    
    Minimal package/return box icon.
    
    Small label: "STEP 01"
    
    Heading: "Return & Reward", Description:
    
    "When your little one outgrows our beautiful clothes, don't let them gather dust. Send them back to us!"
    
    Reward information inside a highlighted horizontal pill/card:
    
    Golden circular badge containing "15%"
    
    Text: "Off your next Kiss & Kry purchase"
    
    Supporting text: "as a token of our appreciation."
    
    Use warm beige/gold background and subtle gold border.
    
    STEP 02 – REDISTRIBUTE & REJOICE
    
    Card styling:
    
    Dark olive background: #495239.
    
    Rounded corners: 22px.
    
    Ivory text.
    
    Top section:
    
    Circular icon.
    
    Minimal home icon.
    
    Small label: "STEP 02"
    
    Heading: "Redistribute & Rejoice"
    
    Description:
    
    "We don't just collect used clothes — we make sure they find a new home within our community."
    
    Below the description, create three small outlined pill indicators with check icons:
    
    Inspected
    
    Cleaned
    
    Given to families in need
    
    Connect both cards visually using a small circular golden arrow positioned between them.
    
    3. SECTION TWO – THE IMPACT
    
    Maintain the same deep olive background.
    
    Create a two-column introduction row.
    
    LEFT SIDE
    
    Eyebrow label:
    "THE IMPACT"
    
    Include a short golden horizontal line.
    
    Heading:
    
    "Making a Difference
    Together."
    
    Use bold ivory typography, approximately 30px.
    
    RIGHT SIDE
    
    Description:
    
    "By joining our Giving Back programme, you're directly helping build a more sustainable future — and supporting those less fortunate. Small actions make a big difference, and with your help we can extend the life of our premium baby clothes and reduce waste."
    
    Use muted sage-beige text, 14px with comfortable line height.
    
    THREE IMPACT CARDS
    
    Below the introduction, create three equal-width columns.
    
    Each column should have:
    
    Thin subtle top border.
    
    Circular outline icon holder.
    
    Small mustard-gold icon.
    
    Ivory heading.
    
    Muted beige description.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(38px,6vw,88px) clamp(22px,5vw,76px);position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-family:var(--font-body-family,'Montserrat',sans-serif)}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}:before,.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}:after{content:'';position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(199,199,173,.16);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}:before{width:370px;height:370px;right:-170px;top:-210px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}:after{width:250px;height:250px;left:-155px;bottom:-145px}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner,.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.92fr 1fr;gap:clamp(38px,7vw,104px);align-items:start}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0 0 22px;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow:before{content:'';width:30px;height:1px;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};flex:0 0 auto}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{margin:0 0 20px;max-width:520px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,54px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.02}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{max-width:510px;margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};font-size:14px;line-height:1.85}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage{position:relative;height:350px;max-width:525px;margin-top:34px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{position:absolute;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(246,242,229,.12)}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--main{left:0;top:0;width:61%;height:100%}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--small{right:0;top:54px;width:47%;height:218px;border:5px solid {{ block.settings.background_color }};box-sizing:border-box}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img,.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg{background:#ddd8cf;color:#817d70}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{position:absolute;left:10px;right:10px;bottom:10px;padding:8px 10px;color:#fff;background:#35402a;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;text-align:center}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill{position:absolute;z-index:2;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 13px;background:{{ block.settings.text_color }};color:#35402a;font-size:10px;font-weight:600}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--one{left:16px;bottom:18px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--two{right:7px;bottom:39px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48%;top:51%;width:104px;height:104px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }};border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.dark_card_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};text-align:center}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal svg{width:31px;height:31px;color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal span{display:block;max-width:76px;font-size:8px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.11em}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{justify-content:space-between}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow:after{content:'';height:1px;background:rgba(199,199,173,.4);flex:1}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards{display:grid;gap:16px;position:relative}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{padding:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);border-radius:22px;background:{{ block.settings.light_card_color }};color:#30352a}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark{background:{{ block.settings.dark_card_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardtop{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:17px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:48px;height:48px;flex:0 0 48px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:#495239;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#343a29}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#62664f}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step{color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card h3{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.2}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card p{margin:0;color:#45493e;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark p{color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:19px;padding:13px 15px;border:1px solid #c49a45;border-radius:16px;background:#f0e2c4;color:#3f402f}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward-badge{width:48px;height:48px;flex:0 0 48px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#343a29;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward strong{display:block;font-size:13px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward span{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;color:#55513f}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__connector{position:absolute;z-index:2;top:50%;left:50%;width:38px;height:38px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }};border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#30352a}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__connector svg{width:18px;height:18px}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__checks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:17px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 9px;border:1px solid rgba(246,242,229,.46);border-radius:999px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:10px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check svg{width:12px;height:12px;color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact{margin-top:clamp(70px,9vw,120px)}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(30px,8vw,110px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:42px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-title{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:clamp(30px,3.1vw,42px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.08}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-copy{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};font-size:14px;line-height:1.85}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:26px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item{padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(199,199,173,.42)}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon{width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:18px;border:1px solid rgba(233,172,41,.65);border-radius:50%;color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item h3{margin:0 0 9px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:17px;font-weight:600}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item p{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}
@media(max-width:749px){.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:100%;padding:42px 22px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font-size:clamp(38px,10vw,48px)}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage{height:300px;margin-top:27px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--small{top:38px;height:190px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal{width:86px;height:86px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal span{font-size:7px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact{margin-top:66px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-bottom:30px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__connector{width:32px;height:32px}}
{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.left_eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">{{ block.settings.intro }}</div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--main">{% if block.settings.return_image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.return_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.return_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.return_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.return_image.height }}">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add an image of your return box</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--small">{% if block.settings.garment_image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.garment_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.garment_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.garment_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.garment_image.height }}">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add a garment image</span>{% endif %}</div><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--one">Step 01 · Return</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--two">Step 02 · Redistribute</span><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal"><div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 7v5h-5M4 17v-5h5"/><path d="M5.6 9A7 7 0 0 1 18 6l2 6M4 12l2 6a7 7 0 0 0 12.4-3"/></svg><span>RETURN · REWARD · REDISTRIBUTE</span></div></div></div></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right"><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.right_eyebrow | escape }}</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards"><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardtop"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 7 9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4Z"/><path d="M3 7v10l9 4 9-4V7M12 11v10"/></svg></span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step">STEP 01</p><h3>{{ block.settings.card_one_title | escape }}</h3></div></div><p>{{ block.settings.card_one_text | escape }}</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward-badge">15%</span><div><strong>Off your next Kiss &amp; Kry purchase</strong><span>as a token of our appreciation.</span></div></div></article><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__connector" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardtop"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6v-7h-4v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V10Z"/></svg></span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step">STEP 02</p><h3>{{ block.settings.card_two_title | escape }}</h3></div></div><p>{{ block.settings.card_two_text | escape }}</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__checks"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 8 3 3 7-7"/></svg>Inspected</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 8 3 3 7-7"/></svg>Cleaned</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 8 3 3 7-7"/></svg>Given to families in need</span></div></article></div></div></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-intro"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">THE IMPACT</p><h2 class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-title">Making a Difference<br>Together.</h2></div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-copy">By joining our Giving Back programme, you're directly helping build a more sustainable future — and supporting those less fortunate. Small actions make a big difference, and with your help we can extend the life of our premium baby clothes and reduce waste.</p></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-grid"><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v3m0 12v3M3 12h3m12 0h3"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>{{ block.settings.impact_one_title | escape }}</h3><p>{{ block.settings.impact_one_text | escape }}</p></article><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-8-4.5-8-11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8-2.8A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 20 10c0 6.5-8 11-8 11Z"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></span><h3>{{ block.settings.impact_two_title | escape }}</h3><p>{{ block.settings.impact_two_text | escape }}</p></article><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v3m0 12v3M3 12h3m12 0h3"/><path d="M7 7l2 2m6 6 2 2m0-10-2 2m-6 6-2 2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/></svg></span><h3>{{ block.settings.impact_three_title | escape }}</h3><p>{{ block.settings.impact_three_text | escape }}</p></article></div></div></section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Giving back","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"header","content":"Introduction"},{"type":"text","id":"left_eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"GIVING BACK"},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Outgrown, Not Outworn."},{"type":"richtext","id":"intro","label":"Description","default":"<p>At Kiss &amp; Kry, we believe true luxury goes beyond premium fabrics and adorable designs. It's compassion, community and sustainability — and it sits at the heart of our 'Giving Back' initiative.</p>"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"return_image","label":"Return box image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"garment_image","label":"Garment image"},{"type":"header","content":"Process cards"},{"type":"text","id":"right_eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE"},{"type":"text","id":"card_one_title","label":"Step 1 title","default":"Return & Reward"},{"type":"textarea","id":"card_one_text","label":"Step 1 description","default":"When your little one outgrows our beautiful clothes, don't let them gather dust. Send them back to us!"},{"type":"text","id":"card_two_title","label":"Step 2 title","default":"Redistribute & Rejoice"},{"type":"textarea","id":"card_two_text","label":"Step 2 description","default":"We don't just collect used clothes — we make sure they find a new home within our community."},{"type":"header","content":"Impact cards"},{"type":"text","id":"impact_one_title","label":"Card 1 heading","default":"Less textile waste"},{"type":"textarea","id":"impact_one_text","label":"Card 1 description","default":"Keep quality babywear in circulation and out of landfill."},{"type":"text","id":"impact_two_title","label":"Card 2 heading","default":"More joyful beginnings"},{"type":"textarea","id":"impact_two_text","label":"Card 2 description","default":"Give thoughtfully cared-for pieces a new home with another family."},{"type":"text","id":"impact_three_title","label":"Card 3 heading","default":"A community that cares"},{"type":"textarea","id":"impact_three_text","label":"Card 3 description","default":"Join a shared effort to make each small action count."},{"type":"header","content":"Colours"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#5E6848"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Primary text","default":"#F6F2E5"},{"type":"color","id":"muted_color","label":"Secondary text","default":"#C7C7AD"},{"type":"color","id":"accent_color","label":"Accent","default":"#E9AC29"},{"type":"color","id":"light_card_color","label":"Light card","default":"#F5F0E9"},{"type":"color","id":"dark_card_color","label":"Dark card","default":"#495239"}],"presets":[{"name":"Giving back"}],"tag":null,"class":"giving-back-block"}{% endschema %}